      "created_at": "2015-01-14T04:45:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey all,</p><p>I wasn't able to see any post related to this, but if I missed it, I apologize. I was just curious if anyone knew if &gt;G was going to be coming to PAX East again this year (fell in love with the game last year at PAX and have bought up everything I can since then to the point where I just picked up my copy of the Kvothe Six String Argent Adept and am only missing the Super Scientific Tachyon promo from the online game). And if they are coming to PAX East, what are likely to be the promo cards (if any) that they bring with them this year? Would it be the Prime Wardens or would they be able to bring Super Scientific Tachyon?</p><p>Thanks in advance, now back to playing with Guise because he is super duper fun.</p>",
